Package: canproj
Title: Cancer Incidence and Mortality Projections
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Matthew T.", "Warkentin", , "matthew.warkentin@ucalgary.ca", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8730-3511")),
      person("Harmony A.", "Smith",, "harmony.smith@ucalgary.ca", role = "aut", 
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-9926-8188")))
Description: An R package for short-term cancer rate projection that extends the 
    functionality other projection models. The objective of this project is to 
    provide and validate a flexible framework for projecting cancer incidence 
    and mortality trends, enabling comparison across multiple modeling 
    approaches and supporting improved forecasting of future cancer burden.
